{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__9_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange your ideal 9 cards on a page of the magic book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOVEMS is an auto-battler deckbuilder where you collect 9 cards to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose, arrange, and entrust\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the cards do the fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are their master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/deck.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In a world where mighty sorcerers clash, forge your ultimate deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies in the 3x3 grid of 9 cards you arrange before the battle begins.<br>Out of countless possibilities, what will you discard, and what will you keep?<br>Your choices will decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__16_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/sample.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Positioning is everything\u2014it holds the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze each card\u2019s traits and uncover the most effective arrangement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where you place your cards determines their effects, action order, and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically position your forces\u2014and crush even the mightiest foes!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__11_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/link.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A card is strong on its own\u2014but even stronger when linked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By linking with others, a card can unleash its true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place cards of the same type side by side, or meet special conditions to trigger transformations and effects that are impossible on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden synergies and discover the ultimate combos to overwhelm your enemies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__14_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/strategy.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield three distinct magic tomes, each with its own set of cards, and forge your unique strategy.</strong><br>With over 120 cards and 100+ link cards, every decision shapes your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Standing in your way are enemies randomly generated for each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange your cards, fight your battles, and push forward toward 10 wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cards you choose, the ones you leave behind, and even those you discard\u2014<br><strong>they all become part of your strategy.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__17_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------<br>Feel free to share and stream your NOVEMS gameplay \u2014 everyone\u2019s welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Victory!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/ec13fba4389f29c9733f7a33b500d877cac2d3a8.jpg"},{"name":"Seeker of Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/0c9b068cb5588a641bba60210623f5e7ba458e70.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice of Arcana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/29ba333a053af78840aaf3eceb517daf7f07ac59.jpg"},{"name":"Sixty-Page War Chronicle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/1ff11a551330a72c114242329475dbd490aba72c.jpg"},{"name":"Mark of a Hundred Battles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/162069b2e57308367edf263b00b95a5a311ae98f.jpg"},{"name":"Misty Link","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/04b18d977ab9b2a04615b18303b386c6f9ef2df7.jpg"},{"name":"Link Archive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/c1ee1100517a1ad8ab513cc804b9aa174e27e680.jpg"},{"name":"Arcana Link","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/0b458a918a1b35b11a4b0e74a3fffedaef2ed623.jpg"},{"name":"Mage of Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/9d79d7c40944f2801261e915d7972755cad69075.jpg"},{"name":"How Do You Turn Lead Into Gold?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549210/affc42fd3d823adb6672b986089e2dd6b296d05f.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549210?t=1750723134","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549210?t=1750723134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/5d769d42acdd54fb2df7dd787382491573a2ebee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750723134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/5d769d42acdd54fb2df7dd787382491573a2ebee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750723134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3764240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__9_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange your ideal 9 cards on a page of the magic book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOVEMS is an auto-battler deckbuilder where you collect 9 cards to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose, arrange, and entrust\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the cards do the fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are their master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/deck.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In a world where mighty sorcerers clash, forge your ultimate deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to victory lies in the 3x3 grid of 9 cards you arrange before the battle begins.<br>Out of countless possibilities, what will you discard, and what will you keep?<br>Your choices will decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__16_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/sample.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Positioning is everything\u2014it holds the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze each card\u2019s traits and uncover the most effective arrangement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where you place your cards determines their effects, action order, and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically position your forces\u2014and crush even the mightiest foes!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__11_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/link.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A card is strong on its own\u2014but even stronger when linked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By linking with others, a card can unleash its true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place cards of the same type side by side, or meet special conditions to trigger transformations and effects that are impossible on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden synergies and discover the ultimate combos to overwhelm your enemies!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__14_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/strategy.png?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wield three distinct magic tomes, each with its own set of cards, and forge your unique strategy.</strong><br>With over 120 cards and 100+ link cards, every decision shapes your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Standing in your way are enemies randomly generated for each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arrange your cards, fight your battles, and push forward toward 10 wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cards you choose, the ones you leave behind, and even those you discard\u2014<br><strong>they all become part of your strategy.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/Videotogif__17_.gif?t=1750723134\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------<br>Feel free to share and stream your NOVEMS gameplay \u2014 everyone\u2019s welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MediaLabGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/32eac27d8b7f6eef0c30a1fb84843efb06852885/header.jpg?t=1750723134","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149610,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamst